OL,3,GNEWSAMilitary base asylum plans
OL,4,Achallenged at High Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners against government plans to
OL,7,Fhouse asylum seekers at a former
OL,8,FMinistry of Defence (MoD) site have
OL,9,Ftaken their complaints to the High
OL,10,FCourt.
OL,12,FThe group Wrong Plan Wrong Site is
OL,13,Fappealing for a judicial review into
OL,14,FHome Office proposals for the former
OL,15,FMoD Bicester site in Oxfordshire.
OL,17,FThe plans, which the government is
OL,18,Ftrying to fast-track using an Urgent
OL,19,FCrown Development application, could
OL,20,Fsee up to 1,256 men housed.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
